; [AUDIT-EXC-001] Cho phep RDP bang NLA tren may chu quan tri (vi du)
; Ly do: <ticket / phe duyet>
Computer
Software\Policies\Microsoft\Windows NT\Terminal Services
UserAuthentication
DWORD:1

; [AUDIT-EXC-002] Dua 1 setting cua baseline ve "Not configured" (vi du)
; Ly do: <ticket / phe duyet>
Computer
Software\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\PowerShell\ScriptBlockLogging
EnableScriptBlockInvocationLogging
DELETE
